  -- approach: iterate the window statement of spec-a70fcca4--h4--h1--h2 — after every skipped m ≥ 1 another skip within (m, 3m+2] — from the skipped step 1: the chain of skips it produces is strictly increasing, so it passes every m; the hole restates that node, which becomes a lemma of this one
